@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Portal user" as User
rectangle "1. Input validation" as Validate
rectangle "2. Product feature engineering" as Features
rectangle "3. Model inference" as Infer
rectangle "4. SHAP and LIME" as Explain
rectangle "5. Explanation checks and Trust Score" as Trust
rectangle "6. History / batch services" as History
rectangle "7. PDF generation" as Report
database "D1: PredictionLog" as Pred
database "D2: BatchUpload" as Batch
User --> Validate : application or CSV
Validate --> Features : valid records
Features --> Infer : transformed product row
Infer --> Explain : class and probability
Explain --> Trust : feature contributions
Trust --> Pred : response and metrics
Trust --> User : evaluation response
User --> History : history / batch request
History <--> Pred
History <--> Batch
User --> Report : report request
Report --> User : PDF document
@enduml
